license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/GregorKornhardt/SOL"
url: "https://github.com/GregorKornhardt/SOL"
abstract: >-
  SOL compares distributions of contextual token embeddings using empirical
  quantile-bin features and double-sliced Wasserstein distance. The sol-metric
  package provides NumPy CPU and optional Torch CUDA execution, transformer
  text encoding, reusable features and frozen LM1B/OpenWebText validation inputs.
keywords:
  - optimal transport
  - language evaluation
  - Wasserstein distance
